{"id":89226104209047,"name":"[UPD7☠️] Survive the Elevator","desc":"You awaken in a place that should not exist—a tower stretching endlessly into a starless sky. The air hums with a strange, living pulse, and the only way forward is an ancient elevator waiting in silence, as if it’s been expecting you.\n\nThey call it Nowhere Tower—a realm between worlds where time fractures and reality bleeds. Each floor below twists into something new: forgotten ruins, warped memories, and creatures that should never have been. Something deep beneath calls your name. \n\nStep inside… and descend into the dark. 👍⬆️\n\n⬆️Update 7:\n✨ Extraction Feature: Take items back to the lobby at any time during playthrough.\n✨ Item Storage Feature: Store your items in a safe within the lobby.\n✨ Imbue Weapons: You can now imbue weapons.\n✨ Elevator Storage Feature: A new storage system.\n✨ New Rooms: 5 New Standard Rooms.\n✨ Full economy rebalancing and distribution.\n\n🛗🛗🛗🛗🛗\nStay tuned for updates! We update weekly!","path":"/game/89226104209047-survive-the-elevator","slug":"89226104209047-survive-the-elevator","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ed522c606ce574dd63d712fac42e49d7d874e01b447f7177446069edb81b30b3.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-5b55b1475b8f582c70f193e41009b953/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":84,"visitor":16533294,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-11-22T06:16:55.586Z","creator":{"name":"Apparently Survival","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"UPD4-Survive-the-Elevator-Can-someone-make-a-script-for-this-game-68859","_id":"69215557bfb8c94179291c23","title":"Can someone make a script for this game","game":{"_id":"691354d52a45bebeccdbdb9e","gameId":89226104209047,"name":"[UPD7☠️] Survive the Elevator","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId"